---
import InfoPage from "../components/InfoPage.astro";
---

<InfoPage title="Commission information">
  <p>
    This is a Phase 1 preview page. Commission intake is not open: the request form creates
    only a local demo summary and does not send, store, or charge for a request.
  </p>
  <h2>Commission categories</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Interview</li>
    <li>Single Illustration</li>
    <li>Image Set</li>
    <li>Quick Story Event</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Final pricing, availability, included revisions, delivery expectations, and supporter-tier
    eligibility will be published by the studio before real intake opens.
  </p>
</InfoPage>
